            "title": "滬指開市跌30點 深成指跌100點",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">內地股市初段持續下滑，上證綜指以3,503點開市，跌30點或0.86%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">深證成指開市報10,155點，亦跌100點或0.98%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">滬深300指數跌23點或0.58%，開報3,931點；創業板指數開市報2,195點，跌16點或0.75%。</p>\n</div>",
