        {
            "title": "範式智能首三季收入增逾53%   股價開升逾4%",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">範式智能(06682)公布，2026年首三季度總收入67.47億元(人民幣‧下同)，按年增長53.3%，遠超去年同期增速。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">範式智能開升4.23%，報18.01元。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：範式智能官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/03/20260326_FI_source-web_06682.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：範式智能官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/03/20260326_FI_source-web_06682.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">圖片來源：範式智能官網</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">毛利潤22.60億元，按年增長39.4%，較去年同期增速明顯提升；毛利率為33.5%，相較2026年上半年提升。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">公布稱，受益於企業端AI資源管理提效需求的持續上升，以及AI大模型推理調用場景落地加速，公司業務加速增長。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">前三季度費用率較2026年上半年下降超2個百分點。與上半年相比，三季度的經營性現金流有較大改善，回款周期縮短。公司財務槓桿很低，三季度人民幣借貸成本為2.25%至2.80%，比上半年有進一步的下降。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17242107-%e7%af%84%e5%bc%8f%e6%99%ba%e8%83%bd%e9%a6%96%e4%b8%89%e5%ad%a3%e6%94%b6%e5%85%a5%e5%a2%9e%e9%80%be53-%e8%82%a1%e5%83%b9%e9%96%8b%e5%8d%87%e9%80%be4",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/05/20230928_FI_source-web_06682.jpg.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-23 09:30:41",
            "source": "bastillepost",
            "kind": 2,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "港股開市︱初段跟跌 恒指跌242點報22,168點 零跑績後低開逾11%",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">港股開市初段跟隨外圍向下，恒生指數開市報22,168點，跌242點或1.08%。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"AP圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/03/20240318_FI_source-ap_港股.png.webp\">\n<img alt=\"AP圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/03/20240318_FI_source-ap_港股.png.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">AP圖片</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">恒生科技指數開報3,443點，跌67點或1.92%；國企指數以7,472點開市，跌81點或1.08%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">重磅股普遍向下，阿里巴巴(09988)開報80.88元，跌3%；騰訊(00700)開報335元，跌2.52%。滙控(00005)開報126.8元，跌1.86%；友邦(01299)開報73.9元，跌0.4%。</p>\n\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：零跑汽車官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/09/20250929_FI_source-web_09863-1.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：零跑汽車官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/09/20250929_FI_source-web_09863-1.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">圖片來源：零跑汽車官網</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">零跑(09863)上周五收市後派成績表，季度純利跌逾73%；該股今早開報26.98元，跌11.48%，股價創52周新底。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">範式智能(06682)首3季毛利增長39.4%；該股今早應聲炒上，開報18.01元，漲4.23%。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17242141-%e6%b8%af%e8%82%a1%e9%96%8b%e5%b8%82%ef%b8%b1%e5%88%9d%e6%ae%b5%e8%b7%9f%e8%b7%8c-%e6%81%92%e6%8c%87%e8%b7%8c242%e9%bb%9e%e5%a0%b122168%e9%bb%9e-%e9%9b%b6%e8%b7%91%e7%b8%be%e5%be%8c%e4%bd%8e%e9%96%8b",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/HKSTOCK.jpg.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-23 09:30:42",
